<section style="background:linear-gradient(135deg, #0A2238 0%, #0D2C47 65%, #0A2238 100%);padding:96px 24px;">
  <div class="hero-grid" style="max-width:1180px;margin:0 auto;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.1fr 0.9fr;gap:56px;align-items:center;">
    <div>
      <span style="display:inline-block;margin-bottom:12px;padding:4px 12px;border-radius:999px;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.12em;text-transform:uppercase;background:rgba(143,208,234,0.18);color:#8FD0EA;border:1px solid rgba(143,208,234,0.3);">About Us</span>
      <h1 style="font-family:'Open Sans',sans-serif;font-weight:800;color:#fff;line-height:1.08;letter-spacing:-0.01em;font-size:clamp(30px,4.4vw,52px);margin:0 0 18px;">Meet Hub City Tank Co, Moncton's Oil Tank Specialists</h1>
      <p style="font-size:18px;line-height:1.7;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.85);max-width:540px;margin:0 0 28px;">We replace and remove residential heating oil tanks across Greater Moncton and Southeast New Brunswick. One trade, done properly, with a free written estimate before any work starts.</p>
      <div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:16px;">
        <a href="tel:+15068023471" class="btn-cream">Call Now — (506) 802-3471</a>
        <a href="/#contact" class="btn-outline-white">Get a Free Estimate</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-img" style="border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 24px 48px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);">
      <img src="/images/about.webp" alt="Meet Hub City Tank Co, Moncton's Oil Tank Specialists" width="800" height="533" style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;display:block;" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high">
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<style>
  @media (max-width: 860px) { .hero-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr !important; } .hero-img { max-height: 320px; } }
</style>
<section style="padding:96px 24px 40px;"><div style="max-width:860px;margin:0 auto;"><div class="rich"><p>If your home runs on heating oil, your tank probably never crosses your mind until something forces it to. Maybe an insurance renewal letter showed up asking for the tank's age, or you spotted rust and a damp patch on the basement floor. That moment is stressful, and it's exactly the moment we built Hub City Tank Co for.</p><p>We keep things simple by doing one kind of work and doing it well. That means <a href="/oil-tank-replacement-moncton/">oil tank replacement</a>, <a href="/oil-tank-removal-moncton/">old tank removal</a>, and the trickier jobs like <a href="/buried-oil-tank-removal-moncton/">buried tank removal</a>. When a tank is actively leaking, our <a href="/emergency-oil-tank-service-moncton/">24/7 emergency line</a> gets you a real person, not a machine.</p><p>We're based in Moncton and we work all over the Hub City area, from <a href="/oil-tank-service-dieppe/">Dieppe</a> and <a href="/oil-tank-service-riverview/">Riverview</a> out to <a href="/oil-tank-service-shediac/">Shediac</a>, <a href="/oil-tank-service-salisbury/">Salisbury</a>, <a href="/oil-tank-service-memramcook/">Memramcook</a> and <a href="/oil-tank-service-sackville/">Sackville</a>. If you're anywhere in Westmorland, Albert or Kent county, you're in our service area. We know these neighbourhoods, the older housing stock, and what local insurers expect from an oil tank.</p><p>Every job starts the same way: a free written estimate with the full price in plain language, so there are no surprises on the invoice. We're licensed and insured, and if you're wondering what a new tank runs these days, our <a href="/oil-tank-replacement-cost/">cost guide</a> lays it out in real Canadian dollars. Call us at <strong>(506) 802-3471</strong> or email info@hubcitytank.ca, and we'll get you sorted.</p></div></div></section>
<section style="padding:0 24px 64px;"><div style="max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto;">
    <span class="kicker">How We Work</span>
    <h2 class="section-heading" style="font-size:clamp(22px,3vw,32px);margin:0 0 28px;">What You Can Expect</h2>
    <div class="feat-grid" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:20px;">
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #DCE6EF;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(13,44,71,0.05);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Open Sans',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:#0D2C47;margin:0 0 8px;">Straight answers</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">You get a free written estimate with the full price before we touch a thing. If we think your tank has a few good years left, we'll tell you that too.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #DCE6EF;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(13,44,71,0.05);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Open Sans',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:#0D2C47;margin:0 0 8px;">Respect for your home</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">We lay down floor protection, pump out any remaining oil safely, and haul the old tank away. When we leave, the only sign we were there is the new tank.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #DCE6EF;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(13,44,71,0.05);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Open Sans',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:#0D2C47;margin:0 0 8px;">There when it counts</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">A leaking tank in January can't wait for office hours. Our 24/7 emergency line is answered around the clock, and leaks go to the front of the queue.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #DCE6EF;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(13,44,71,0.05);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Open Sans',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:#0D2C47;margin:0 0 8px;">Local through and through</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">We live and work in Greater Moncton, so we know the housing stock, the winters, and what New Brunswick insurers ask for. That local knowledge saves you time and back-and-forth.</p>
      </div>
</div>
<style>
  @media (max-width: 860px) { .feat-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr !important; } }
</style>
  </div></section>
<section style="padding:96px 24px;background:#EEF4FA;">
  <div style="max-width:860px;margin:0 auto;">
    <span class="kicker">FAQ</span>
    <h2 class="section-heading" style="font-size:clamp(24px,3.5vw,36px);margin:0 0 32px;">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
    <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;">
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #DCE6EF;border-radius:8px;padding:24px 28px;">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Open Sans',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:#0D2C47;margin:0 0 10px;">Are you licensed and insured?</h3>
        <p style="font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;margin:0;">Yes. Hub City Tank Co is licensed and insured for residential oil tank work, and we're happy to show proof before the job starts. Your insurer can get a copy of the paperwork for their file too.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #DCE6EF;border-radius:8px;padding:24px 28px;">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Open Sans',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:#0D2C47;margin:0 0 10px;">How much does an estimate cost?</h3>
        <p style="font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;margin:0;">Nothing. Estimates are free, written, and good for the price we quote. We come out, look at your setup, and hand you the full number with no obligation to book.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #DCE6EF;border-radius:8px;padding:24px 28px;">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Open Sans',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:#0D2C47;margin:0 0 10px;">What should I do if my tank is leaking right now?</h3>
        <p style="font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;color:#555;margin:0;">Call our 24/7 emergency line at (506) 802-3471. Shut off the tank valve if you can reach it safely, keep kids and pets away from the area, and don't try to move the tank yourself. We'll walk you through the next steps on the phone.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<section style="background:linear-gradient(135deg, #0D2C47 0%, #1D6396 50%, #0D2C47 100%);padding:64px 24px;text-align:center;">
  <h2 style="font-family:'Open Sans',sans-serif;font-size:clamp(26px,4vw,40px);font-weight:800;color:#fff;margin-bottom:16px;">Need Help in Greater Moncton and Southeast New Brunswick? Call for Same-Day Service.</h2>
  <p style="font-size:16px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.8);margin-bottom:28px;max-width:520px;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;">Free written estimates. Emergency calls answered around the clock.</p>
  <div style="display:flex;justify-content:center;gap:16px;flex-wrap:wrap;">
    <a href="tel:+15068023471" class="btn-cream">Call Now — (506) 802-3471</a>
    <a href="/#contact" class="btn-outline-white">Get Free Estimate</a>
  </div>
</section>

</Layout>
